   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CEA103 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 10 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13245 (subject CEA201, used as reference) · Decision 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 22/08/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CEA103 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>10 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13245 (môn CEA201, dùng làm tham khảo) · QĐ 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 22/08/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Explain the general functions and structure of a digital computer</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Present an overview of the evolution of computer technology from early digital computers to the latest microprocessors.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Understand the key performance issues that relate to computer design</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Describe in detail the essential elements of computer organisation including internal bus, memory, Input/Output ( I/O) organisations and interfacing standards and discuss how these elements function;</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Summarize, at a top level, the key functions of an operating system (OS).</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Be able to apply Boolean algebra and digital logic to design and interpret complex digital circuits;</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Present various types of addressing modes common in instruction sets, an essential characteristics of machine instructions, types of operands supported by typical machine instruction sets</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>CLO8</strong></td><td>Explain processor structure and function in details, the operations of Reduced Instruction Set Computers</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td><strong>CLO9</strong></td><td>Investigate, evaluate and communicate general trends in computing technologies such as Instruction-Level Parallelism and Superscalar Processors</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>10</td><td><strong>CLO10</strong></td><td>Using AI tools and simulator tools to futher explore the main concepts</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13245\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13245</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13245\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13245</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
